What actually happens at execution time?

You define a CloudWatch Logs metric filter on a JSON-formatted log group:

```text
Log events:
1 {"ts":"2026-04-01T12:00:00Z","level":"ERROR","msg":"db timeout","code":504}
2 {"ts":"2026-04-01T12:00:05Z","level":"WARN","msg":"slow","code":200}
3 {"ts":"2026-04-01T12:00:10Z","level":"ERROR","msg":"panic","code":500}
```

Filter pattern:

```text
{ $.level = "ERROR" && $.code >= 500 }
```
